Component User
    Port ResetPress Output ResetCommand
    Port SwitchMovement Output OperatingCommand
    Port Ear Input WarningTone
    Port Eyes Input WarningLight

    Function perceiveAlarm()
    Function hearSiren()
    Function seeWarningLight()
    Function reset()

Function User.perceiveAlarm
    Parallel
        Call hearSiren
        Call seeWarningLight
    Join
